// # emit-x86 string plus unary-minus concat
//
// Logline: Print n= plus unary-minus 7 so emit-x86 can lower STRING plus a const negative INT.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet. No hello fold.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Concat n= and unary-minus 7.
//   3. Print the result.
//
// residual: greet calls stay later.

pub fn main() {
    println("n=" + -7);
}
